    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "The product of a certain whole number and three less than that number is 108. Find the number.\n\nIntroduce a pronumeral, write down a quadratic equation and solve it.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$12$",
      "worked": "Let $n$ be the whole number.\n$$\\begin{align*}n(n-3)&=108\\\\n^2-3n-108&=0\\\\(n-12)(n+9)&=0\\\\n-12&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad n+9=0\\\\n&=12\\quad\\text{or}\\quad n=-9\\end{align*}$$\nSince $n$ is a whole number, reject $-9$. The number is $12$.\n\nCheck: $12(12-3)=108$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 56
  },
